<title>USA: Metrocall gets $350 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Metrocall gets $350 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metrocall Inc said Friday it entered into a new $350 million senior secured credit facility underwritten by Toronto-Dominion Bank and First National Bank of Boston.</p>
<p>The credit will be used to finance Metrocall's acquisitions, fund capital and operating expenditures and for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>Alexandria-based Metrocall provides paging and wireless messaging services to over 1.3 million subscribers in all 50 states.</p>
</text>
